<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container-high leading-snug">
          more likely to be targeted by online scams and coercive tactics
        </div>
</div>
<div class="bg-inverse-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform">
<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-2 -translate-y-2 opacity-10 text-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[88px]">hub</span>
</div>
<div class="font-display text-[44px] leading-none text-primary-fixed font-normal mb-3">3</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container-high leading-snug">
          specialized AI agents coordinating seamlessly in real time
        </div>
</div>
<div class="bg-inverse-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform">
<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-2 -translate-y-2 opacity-10 text-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[88px]">fact_check</span>
</div>
<div class="font-display text-[44px] leading-none text-secondary-fixed font-normal mb-3">100%</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container-high leading-snug">
          rule-based risk scoring — deterministic and fully auditable
        </div>
</div>
<div class="bg-inverse-surface rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform">
<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-2 -translate-y-2 opacity-10 text-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[88px]">lock_reset</span>
</div>
<div class="font-display text-[44px] leading-none text-surface font-normal mb-3">0</div>
<div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-surface-container-high leading-snug">
          passwords, payment numbers, or state IDs ever requested
        </div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- The Problem Section -->
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mb-10">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-semibold">The Context &amp; Gap</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Why existing protective tools aren't enough</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
        Conventional cyber security focuses on technical perimeters rather than subtle human persuasion, leaving critical blind spots for vulnerable users.
      </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
<!-- Left side: Problem Illustration Infographic -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold">Social Engineering Trap</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-error-container text-on-error-container font-label-sm text-label-sm">High Friction</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">The Silence in the Grey Areas</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            Technical filters successfully block known malicious links, but they cannot interpret social manipulation, artificial urgency, or friendship mimicry.
          </p>
<!-- SVG Visual Representation -->
<div class="my-4 bg-surface rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span>Automated Antivirus</span>
<span class="text-secondary font-semibold">Clean (Pass)</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-high h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-secondary h-full w-full"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant pt-2">
<span>Coercive Emotional Pressure</span>
<span class="text-tertiary font-semibold">Undetected (Danger)</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-high h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-tertiary h-full w-[85%]"></div>
</div>
<div class="pt-2 text-center">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant italic">
                "Technical protection says it is safe. Context proves otherwise."
              </span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px]">lightbulb</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
            DIVERT1 bridges the gap between binary firewall rules and human nuance.
          </span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right side: 3 Problem Cards -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]">crisis_alert</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Higher targeting risk</h4>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Neurodivergent individuals are statistically more likely to be deliberately targeted by fraudsters using rapid emotional pacing, specialized interest hijacking, and social isolation.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-tertiary-container/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[24px]">block</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Tools only block — they don't explain</h4>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Spam flags, browser red-screens, and generic block lists rarely state <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">why</span> an interaction is alarming or guide the user through constructive, calm next actions.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-container/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[24px]">menu_book</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Safety lessons are hard to follow</h4>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Traditional safety materials often rely on ambiguous idioms, sarcastic examples, or presumed neurotypical social instincts, creating secondary confusion in high-anxiety moments.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Who It Is For: User Cohort Cards -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-16 px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-10">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 max-w-xl mx-auto">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-semibold">User Experience Focus</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Who it is built for</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Crafted to preserve independence and self-advocacy without patronizing language.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
<!-- Card 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">psychology_alt</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Neurodivergent Young Adults</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Autistic people and people with ADHD who are navigating independent living, digital employment, or university life. Highly articulate, authentic, and naturally comfortable communicating via online spaces.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-4 bg-surface-container-high/40 rounded-lg p-3">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-medium">Core Asset: Clear, literal processing</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-tertiary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">balance</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">New to Adult Risks</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Encountering ambiguous demands for the first time: urgent peer payments, gift-card requests, romance escalation, or manipulative "if you really trust me" ultimatums from virtual acquaintances.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-4 bg-surface-container-high/40 rounded-lg p-3">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary font-medium">Need: Step-by-step decision validation</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">supervisor_account</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Support Network Often Absent</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Family members, student mentors, and support specialists cannot be present at 2:00 AM on a chat platform. Young adults need an immediate, non-judgmental soundboard right when situations unfold.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-4 bg-surface-container-high/40 rounded-lg p-3">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-medium">Outcome: Real-time autonomous triage</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Multi-Agent Architecture Section -->
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 mb-12">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-semibold">Technical Blueprint</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Our Solution — Multi-Agent Architecture</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
        Three specialized actors coordinated under IBM watsonx Orchestrate to separate conversation handling, objective risk analysis, and trauma-informed supportive guidance.
      </p>
</div>
<!-- Agent Workflow Graphic -->
<div class="relative bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative z-10">
<!-- Agent 1 -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm relative">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">Interface</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px]">smart_toy</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Main Chatbot Agent</h3>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            Welcomes the user into a low-sensory environment. Asks exactly one short question at a time to prevent cognitive overload, gently collecting conversation context.
          </p>
<div class="mt-2 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-3 text-[12px] font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">Pacing control:</span> Max 1 inquiry per conversational turn
          </div>
</div>
<!-- Agent 2 -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm relative">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">Scoring Engine</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[28px]">search_check</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Safety Agent</h3>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            Deterministic rule-based risk scoring. Evaluates patterns across 4 dimensions: urgency, financial redirection, isolation cues, and tone shifts over time.
          </p>
<div class="mt-2 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-3 text-[12px] font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">Yields:</span> Risk level + Exact phrases of concern
          </div>
</div>
<!-- Agent 3 -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm relative">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">Advocacy</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[28px]">support_agent</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Support Agent</h3>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            Synthesizes raw risk findings into a calm, grounding summary with 2–3 actionable, non-pressured pathways. Offers pre-drafted neutral replies.
          </p>
<div class="mt-2 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-3 text-[12px] font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="font-semibold text-on-surface">Empowerment:</span> Scripted neutral deferrals &amp; verification
          </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Connecting Architecture Bar -->
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]">verified</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">Auditable Data Handshake</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-center md:text-right">
          No external model weights decide risk scores. The Safety Agent outputs transparent criteria before the Support Agent renders human text.
        </p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Core Differentiators -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-high/30 py-16 px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-semibold">Distinct Value</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Key Differentiators</h2>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">troubleshoot</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Whole-conversation analysis</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Rather than isolated keyword matching that flags benign sentences, DIVERT1 monitors behavioral arcs, shifting dynamics, and relationship pacing across entire chat logs.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">forum</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Explains the why</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Replaces vague red alert banners with clear, pedagogical logic. It details why a message creates artificial pressure, strengthening individual cyber discernment.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">favorite</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Respects friendships</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Recognizes that genuine friends sometimes need emergency help. It flags account compromise possibilities and recommends out-of-band checks without accusing the friend.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">sentiment_satisfied</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Avoids over-warning</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Sensory fatigue occurs when safety tools cry wolf. DIVERT1 validates safe, genuine conversations with positive reassurance rather than nervous warnings.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Responsible Design & MVP Scope -->
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 flex flex-col gap-12">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-semibold">Governance &amp; Boundaries</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Responsible Design &amp; MVP Scope</h2>
</div>
<!-- 5 Core Principles Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[22px]">label_off</span>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Never labels</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Never calls someone a "scammer". Focuses entirely on observable message behaviors.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[22px]">front_hand</span>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">User decides</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Never locks the screen or imposes mandatory blocks. Agency remains with the user.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[22px]">vpn_key_off</span>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">No secrets</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Will never accept or store credentials, passkeys, financial PINs, or ID uploads.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[22px]">policy</span>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Fully auditable</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Rule heuristics are plain text rules, not inaccessible black-box probabilities.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-5 rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[22px]">translate</span>
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Clear language</h4>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          Zero metaphors, idioms, or ambiguous sarcasm in safety assessments.
        </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Scope Matrix: In MVP vs Out of MVP -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
<!-- Included -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">check_circle</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Included in Current Scope (MVP)</h3>
</div>
<ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
            Real-time chat log copy-paste analysis
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
            Deterministic rule-based risk classification
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
            Low-sensory, high-contrast, calm interface mode
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
            Template response generation for respectful boundaries
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
            Plain-English safety concept library &amp; glossaries
          </li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- Not in MVP -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[22px]">hourglass_top</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Planned for Future Cycles (Out of Scope)</h3>
</div>
<ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
            Direct OS screen recording or silent background monitoring
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
            Automated contact blocking or account suspension actions
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
            Financial account or banking API integrations
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
            Automated parent or supervisor notification alerts
          </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span>
            Automated law enforcement incident dispatching
          </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Tech Stack Architecture Chips -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-4">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-outline font-semibold">Engineered With</span>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">IBM watsonx Orchestrate</span>
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">Multi-Agent Orchestration</span>
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">Rule-Based Risk Scoring</span>
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">Python 3.11</span>
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">Transparent Heuristics</span>
<span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md">Neuro-Inclusive UX</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Grounding Footer -->
<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest mt-10 py-12 px-6 lg:px-8 shadow-sm">
<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-normal">DIVERT1</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-medium">Safe Space Companion</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-center md:text-left">
          Dedicated to unconditional psychological safety and autonomous online confidence.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-6">
<div class="flex flex-col text-right">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">Powered by</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">IBM watsonx</span>
</div>
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">spa</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</footer>
</div></main></div>

</body></html>